{% comment %}
  Star rating row for the product buy box.

  The text is richtext, so the count can carry its own emphasis and its own
  links. That is also why the row is only wrapped in an anchor when a Rating
  Link is actually set: an unset link used to render href="#", and now that the
  text may contain a link of its own, an always-on wrapper would nest anchors.

  Accepts:
  - block {Object} - the rating block. Reads settings.text and settings.link.

  Usage:
  {% render 'CWC_pdp-rating__block', block: block %}
{% endcomment %}

<div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__rating" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <span class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__stars" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span>
  {% if block.settings.text != blank %}
    {% if block.settings.link != blank %}
      <a href="{{ block.settings.link }}" class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__rating-link cwc-rte">
        {{ block.settings.text }}
      </a>
    {% else %}
      <div class="cwc_product-hero-buy-box__rating-link cwc-rte">
        {{ block.settings.text }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
</div>
